hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1651","Narrated to us 'Abd al-Jabbar ibn al-'Ala', Sa'id ibn 'Abd al-Rahman al-Makhzumi, and Ahmad ibn 'Abdah. They said: Sufyan narrated to us, on the authority of al-Zuhri, that he heard Anas ibn Malik narrating that the Prophet (ﷺ) said:\n\n*\When the evening meal is ready while the prayer is about to be established"," start with the evening meal.\""*\n\nThis is the narration of 'Abd al-Jabbar.\n\nAl-Makhzumi and Ahmad said: *On the authority of al-Zuhri.*\n\nAhmad said: *On the authority of Anas.*\n\n**CHAPTER:**"""
